<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-22T00:32:07.809Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF imposed a night curfew in Sennar as fighting intensified in the Blue Nile, while drone strikes near aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan caused civilian casualties. RSF forces closed in on Ed Damazin, prompting Burhan to reassure residents, and a protester was killed in Darfur during a demonstration. Humanitarian conditions worsened as most charity kitchens in Khartoum shut, leaving many facing starvation, and a Christian girl was killed by her brother while trying to escape a forced marriage. The conflict resulted in 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNVlRGdXFMN0pfQ3ZyTGxBLUZxNkozN24yTnUwZGZYUExvaXd0MWJnMkJ4OEZWZ2lDT1R4cEQzYmRjeEh1YzA3dnhFcTBpaUpHeGZRbVhfNGNzODFUYm5TaGZCM2xoZGlxQkZIQzMyLVVrRUN4aHdLS2NTN2JXSWthOWd5MDlkR3UzRVNoVVZuTm4wd210NklwZzlVS2xfc1o2MEFRQ0N2M0tkQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9fT2dMZzZRWm9od1ZJV2o5djB0TEM3UzZHTjVoa2pLSGhrdVNYb2QxblpWbUpsSU82TEhpUHgycU5DdE5hNERfdUNDSWoxYkdrWGxYN3NNdEFkN05yNDJUeEhpWEtCWjFDMU9pRWVUaHdraDkxNkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFA1TGNNLVZrSGJTQmoyVXF5U3NyXzFfbmJLU2l1LVFoelJWMEFoMkwyM0JMdmIyajN1QmRzWjV1R3dwYlFxX0xqZ0NQeXRMdnlp?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNenl3MEtPQjFubVRadEhNS29ZTEcyeFpVTWNNMmt1dzJwMmJ2MWtIbXFFaWxrWno5dUJUczNHSjNIR0otdEU0Z3hwN2pOckE4bFJiU2RQRnBfTXItQ19jZmtlVV9qZ2tJenVXN1phNlVWRTNsYjZISDF1am